<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear {!IndividualApplication.PI_Name__c},</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you for submitting your application titled “<b>{!IndividualApplication.Project_Title__c}</b>” (Application ID: {!IndividualApplication.Name}).</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">After careful review, we regret to inform you that your application has<b> not been shortlisted for presentation</b> before the Selection Committee.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We sincerely appreciate the effort and commitment you have invested in your proposal. While it has not been selected at this stage, we encourage you to continue developing your ideas and consider applying in future rounds.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We wish you all the best in your future endeavors and look forward to your continued engagement.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Sincerely,</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>Wadhwani Foundation</b></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>